<title>USA: Clinton to meet economic advisers on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Clinton to meet economic advisers on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton did not have his regular weekly meeting with economic advisers on Tuesday but will meet them on Wednesday, White House spokesman Mike McCurry told reporters on Wednesday.</p>
<p>McCurry had told reporters on Tuesday that the meeting was to take place on Tuesday.</p>
